{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873330/extras/8a14120ef149ccec288b7d154c2ac4f7.poster.avif?t=1768774171\" width=1170 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873330/extras/8a14120ef149ccec288b7d154c2ac4f7.webm?t=1768774171\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873330/extras/8a14120ef149ccec288b7d154c2ac4f7.mp4?t=1768774171\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Redhowl</strong> is a top-down social deduction game that immerses you in the world of Little Red Riding Hood. Developed by the independent studio <strong>BENOM STUDIO</strong>, it\u2019s an online multiplayer game for 4 to 15 players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll find yourself in Grandmother\u2019s village, deep within the Redhowl forest. Far from the idyllic childhood tale\u2026 Take on multiple roles to uncover within three factions: the Little Hoods, the Wolves, and the Voiceless. Only teamwork and your deduction skills will save the village.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873330/extras/19f1b85572598cea780714fc4de2c758.avif?t=1768774171\" width=610 height=183 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Redhowl</strong> alternates between day, night, and council phases. There is also a Blood Moon, a nightmarish variant of the night phase. Each player has powers and objectives unique to their role and faction. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the day, the village thrives by completing daily quests assigned by Grandmother and ensuring everything runs smoothly. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At night, the Hoods and Voiceless have limited vision, while the Wolves can transform and devour their prey. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At dawn, the village gathers to share observations and deductions. When the council ends, each player votes alone, following their conscience. Then, everyone gathers in the town square to find out whether a player has been executed by the village.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873330/extras/0e5cb2e03a614a75d0c8bfd23161ae13.avif?t=1768774171\" width=610 height=183 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Little Hoods Faction</strong>: The Hood, the Village Donkey, the Tax Collector, the Falconer, the Medium, the Revenant, the Politician, the Trapper, the Undertaker and the renowned Hunter!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Wolves Faction</strong>: The Wolf and the Fanatic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Voiceless Faction</strong>: The Assassin.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features :</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique factions and roles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable games: plenty of variations to suit your preferences</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cosmetics: colors and skins</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proximity voice chat</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3873330?t=1768774171","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873330/22bcb28537e5e920a52185d5eab0f2178ba54b44/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768774171","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873330/0525a877e5c4b619ec479dd29d12945bd482473a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768774171","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873330/0525a877e5c4b619ec479dd29d12945bd482473a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768774171","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873330/extras/8a14120ef149ccec288b7d154c2ac4f7.poster.avif?t=1768774171\" width=1170 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873330/extras/8a14120ef149ccec288b7d154c2ac4f7.webm?t=1768774171\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873330/extras/8a14120ef149ccec288b7d154c2ac4f7.mp4?t=1768774171\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Redhowl</strong> is a top-down social deduction game that immerses you in the world of Little Red Riding Hood. Developed by the independent studio <strong>BENOM STUDIO</strong>, it\u2019s an online multiplayer game for 4 to 15 players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll find yourself in Grandmother\u2019s village, deep within the Redhowl forest. Far from the idyllic childhood tale\u2026 Take on multiple roles to uncover within three factions: the Little Hoods, the Wolves, and the Voiceless. Only teamwork and your deduction skills will save the village.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873330/extras/19f1b85572598cea780714fc4de2c758.avif?t=1768774171\" width=610 height=183 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Redhowl</strong> alternates between day, night, and council phases. There is also a Blood Moon, a nightmarish variant of the night phase. Each player has powers and objectives unique to their role and faction. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the day, the village thrives by completing daily quests assigned by Grandmother and ensuring everything runs smoothly. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At night, the Hoods and Voiceless have limited vision, while the Wolves can transform and devour their prey. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At dawn, the village gathers to share observations and deductions. When the council ends, each player votes alone, following their conscience. Then, everyone gathers in the town square to find out whether a player has been executed by the village.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873330/extras/0e5cb2e03a614a75d0c8bfd23161ae13.avif?t=1768774171\" width=610 height=183 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Little Hoods Faction</strong>: The Hood, the Village Donkey, the Tax Collector, the Falconer, the Medium, the Revenant, the Politician, the Trapper, the Undertaker and the renowned Hunter!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Wolves Faction</strong>: The Wolf and the Fanatic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Voiceless Faction</strong>: The Assassin.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features :</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique factions and roles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable games: plenty of variations to suit your preferences</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cosmetics: colors and skins</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proximity voice chat</p></li></ul>","developers":["BENOM STUDIO"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873330/5a06bc5d1319f54c8e221a6b4b1dc5b64f188a44/header.jpg?t=1768774171","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3873330/1024480106/901278ab594abc515c721a81cd868f098b2e48c8/1767462506/dash_av1.mpd?t=1767478791","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3873330/1024480106/901278ab594abc515c721a81cd868f098b2e48c8/1767462506/dash_h264.mpd?t=1767478791","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3873330/1024480106/901278ab594abc515c721a81cd868f098b2e48c8/1767462506/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1767478791","id":257241418,"name":"Redhowl I Official teaser","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257241418/dd8d71380039954c973a9fc19612d8a4040a5335/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1767478791"}],"name":"Redhowl","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong>  Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Intel Core i3-8100 / AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8000 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1050 Ti / AMD Radeon RX 560<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5000 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong>  Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>